Third-party papers in this folder

These PDFs are unmodified copies of the latest arXiv version of each paper, downloaded
on 2026-10-26 and renamed for convenience. Copyright remains with the authors. They are
redistributed here under the licenses their authors chose on arXiv, and are used only as
test documents for this project.

